{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:edb1191a48248c79ac4d9b3f99efbd860c8c23361586008ec20ff560a3cb68bd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23:5_02_005_23:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b865203ceb196139a167b1e3173f8ca427babc45fb1624df7c142581d9fc9d4",
      "text": "制作人，你回来了吗。\n我正好有事找你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23:5_02_005_23:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b412384981ed57a0b3079d1bf8d22233f34c640b989a05760b2ad475ba3104bd",
      "text": "让您久等了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23:5_02_005_23:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b25ec53df11d813a61df042c63f128d9dba81a3f45daf93d95b9d1433d8755c2",
      "text": "不……倒也不是什么大不了的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23:5_02_005_23:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26cae916b02a55418083c863aa647453414b595313e46ff2087af75ed826447a",
      "text": "我只是想着把这个交给你。\n这是白色情人节的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23:5_02_005_23:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f575a152833a55ddef4dc76e8a35551abf452eed66934092d56f8198071cf373",
      "text": "（这个包装是……只有在那家百货商场才能买到的\n点心！特意去那里买来的吗！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23:5_02_005_23:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce6196d7cc1a7be0175960f0327ff1326bbdf947eb583fe5914825fc07eab4c",
      "text": "怎么了？不收下吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23:5_02_005_23:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29945a7c5b611cbd70b5e01ede32ad413cd723b9e26c586386700c5f9c0eac9c",
      "text": "不……！因为是我知道的名牌点心，\n稍微有点惊讶到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23:5_02_005_23:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dca1ce49d2736ede922551f286f3da85a0b3c340a515ba906f77ffe85c4c1690",
      "text": "排了相当久的队吧？\n这盒点心我会好好品尝的。非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23:5_02_005_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1cafe43b41f10832da875c13e4c08a5795a0506b3d5aab8def37f2bd551eee0",
      "text": "临近白色情人节大概都是那种景象吧。\n算不上什么大不了的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_005_23_5_02_005_23:5_02_005_23:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6a37a5c0b6f04e18711eda417dad46894894bf87a9357d7c235d41ce9de1bad",
      "text": "欠你的人情，这下就算是还清了。那我走了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
